+ * queue along with a lock/mutex in the OS specific headers and
+ * implementation files::
+ * - SCTP_TIMERQ_LOCK()
+ * - SCTP_TIMERQ_UNLOCK()
+ * - SCTP_TIMERQ_LOCK_INIT()
+ * - SCTP_TIMERQ_LOCK_DESTROY()
